er impressed by this PJ's! I just stopped in for a quick coffee and a croissant, but considering it's in the Quarter, I was happy that it was only $6. Don't you hate places that upcharge, due to location? This shop was following all proper Covid precautions and Julie (I think that was her name) was super nice. Stop in, if you're in the area!"},{"business_id":"rIPy-Q-w4hrvcdSbCakXpg","review_id":"SPghm--8h0CcKiv78zYn7A","date":"2018-06-17T19:18:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9117300510406494,"text_excerpt":"I wanted to try this place because they have a lot of options for frozen coffee, which I like, and they are Louisiana specific, so I've never been before. I tried their Iced Mocha as well as a brownie, both of which were pretty solid (better than Starbucks). The interior was nice and comfortable as well."},{"business_id":"rIPy-Q-w4hrvcdSbCakXpg","review_id":"O17C831nuu_-2a30YUR9nw","date":"2016-12-03T00:27:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9074195027351379,"text_excerpt":"Conveniently located next to the French Market Inn. This coffee shop opens early and has pastries coming freshly out of the oven. I saw one of the staff removing croissants and cookies from the oven which is much better than seeing day old pastries or sweets that were shipped to the store ready to sell. In addition there is a large selection of coffee and non coffee drinks. I only tried their hot chocolate which was good but had the weather been hotter I would have wanted to try their iced hot chocolate."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rIPy-Q-w4hrvcdSbCakXpg","photo_id":"6VJFY5atnd8-nOA9SGNkZQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6VJFY5atnd8-nOA9SGNkZQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9035862684249878},{"business_id":"rIPy-Q-w4hrvcdSbCakXpg","photo_id":"L6QDSVQom9R7HyL9uAxLAQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/L6QDSVQom9R7HyL9uAxLAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8353369235992432},{"business_id":"rIPy-Q-w4hrvcdSbCakXpg","photo_id":"qu88_pFNC4zLh2DpAkb2Ng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qu88_pFNC4zLh2DpAkb2Ng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7996690273284912}]},"notebook_case":null}
